# The hippo's dung flick played afloat, frame by frame (the river food web's step 6, 2026-11-23; CLAUDE.md's hard rule:
# every animation checked in the game, frozen and stepped, from three sides). A led hippo named film:dung_flick floats in
# a pool 3 deep (the game's own floating, its eyes, ears and back out) and plays only that clip: side on, three quarters
# from behind (the tail's spin at the waterline) and from the front. Stepped 2 ticks a picture over the 1.6 s clip.
#   ./gradlew runFilm -PfilmScene=tools/film/hippo_dung_frames.film   pictures in run-film/screenshots/hippo_dung_frames/
cmd time set noon
cmd weather clear
cmd kill @e[type=!player]
cmd fill 26 -63 -10 48 -61 10 minecraft:water
lens 40
wait 40
cmd summon antcolonies:hippo 37.5 -63 0.5 {OwnSize:1.0f,Led:1b,Rotation:[-90f,0f],CustomName:'"film:dung_flick"'}
camera 37.5 -59.8 -9.0 0 6
wait 60
cmd tick freeze
burst dung_side 17 2
cmd tick unfreeze
camera 29.0 -58.8 -6.5 -50 14
wait 20
cmd tick freeze
burst dung_behind 17 2
cmd tick unfreeze
camera 46.5 -59.6 0.5 90 6
wait 20
cmd tick freeze
burst dung_front 17 2
cmd tick unfreeze
